        "Title": "The Icelander&apos;s Vengence",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126259530666",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository d70b11ae-0347-468c-ba9d-c4b1f2c190d5).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are of an unusual variety this time. Corrupt Icelandic Minister of Finances, Bjarni Benediktsson, is on Haven Island for a &quot;vacation&quot; where he intends to bargain for a tax shelter with one of his more nefarious associates, Jacqueline Wealth and Carrie Long. There under the alias of &apos;Malcolm Roberts&apos;, Bjarni Benediktsson will likely be enjoying his leisure somewhere on the island. Our client wants his death to be public but you have free reign over his associates.\r\rGood Luck, 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.8.0.0",
